<title>USA: Witco Corp says to consolidate facilities.</title>
<headline>Witco Corp says to consolidate facilities.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Witco Corp said Wednesday it will consolidate its production of specialty chemicals at major manufacturing plant, bringing its number of plant sites to 31 from 46.</p>
<p>The company also said it has authorized more than $50 million for modernization, expansion and safety and environmental improvements at its manufacturing plant in Memphis, Tenn.</p>
